://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1H0L7Z_HktsQ7kNvwF0TDZK&_nc_oc=Adr54XnCATaG19uJpOysXDvwcRt_j1rJDrp1VSKs4xkZa_7fgiqgvQHOGP0QOedXiK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAgk5pGQVKS9laIYpFJgNrOsXZRCqYBtoIP6W_W5fCLlg&oe=6A5A4566"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VGtpT49CGmoQ7kNvwFD0Ez0&_nc_oc=AdoqrRJ4PIbJpcrco-X-ZJyQRUL5zJU4MmW0g78KP1HgVgCfsEXsocgLZ_rGR2O6H70&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCA6Ft2yfdR5e2VINLt2fOiMSzN3EJWasY9fVOyZ7tUBA&oe=6A5A3AB2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6t1QsFCiUxgQ7kNvwGQCDm-&_nc_oc=AdoQ5p5LdAqKty0a-9BbtJQu8kpHFIRQmc4KTKDQGRk6_ci6sk0OFJsw7oqog_ub0zA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDgsHUWua98U200Zk23qwrPtrcrmlItvueg3TnTwLR8xQ&oe=6A5A347B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f7GE93-U7rYQ7kNvwHqnc0m&_nc_oc=AdqBq_VlHK0NAIm3Kt71AyGicuv4I3NbUOE84GSeU0v8DuOH_5pdlM3rl5krQelLDQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD60uR37Y7wpFbJdgiNHShrI2ThepsWMpuz2eZBAlSnpw&oe=6A5A49F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rfr4UQ5wGzAQ7kNvwFgDABt&_nc_oc=Adqnxh9NCWi0Dj3YyhMC1322Zn-liRpZUjxNOpASpY7NXlXo6L1vQ8kfPfGJoFpk1dM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDbvZR1Lb8sWIxxG6-v1VGzw4WSLLCwky9eLoCCnJ4lgA&oe=6A5A47F2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DxMq-BoOiYsQ7kNvwE_INam&_nc_oc=AdoSmMe-HUH8gyExfryZ4QbJPSYkeSpzYEzhQJ0xkG3cFRdgexYcqOSPQukR7TIhUP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQClSphZq0WGMddJkM8n_BsHjppJwjKeX-k3TKG3hlmVxw&oe=6A5A3F53"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N4lOp0N0x4AQ7kNvwHJDDmP&_nc_oc=AdrGc-_MVgV2z6UPNbOJyqb-e4cnq8JVpeWuTjbE2PjfaQXwJaFVlEwTOVhaclPS8fU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBl4kFFy8NMWoPpnTPmYtXw2s2tfH2KAwf_Z0cvIjD2Ng&oe=6A5A3B6F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lau5SP9-74wQ7kNvwEniEKl&_nc_oc=AdqVeSA8PsYHG7QNaOzuUy0EvGGR95b0DzbIfgr5F1AMON5o117xBhJJYxpG7LtHnH0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCnbjKwnmyKC4u2kbaezq1mHWbNCR5dW45VbE6v2lfpGg&oe=6A5A4722"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164